## Bug Log

| # | File | Bug | Severity | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `index.js` | `SIGINT` handler indented inside `run()` body — misleading scope | Low | ⚠️ Cosmetic (works, confusing) |
| 2 | `index.js` | `rl.on("close")` registered after `run()` call | Low | ⚠️ Cosmetic (works) |
| 3 | `geminiClient.js` | Default model `gemini-3-flash-preview` does not exist | **High** | ❌ Will fail at runtime |
| 4 | `geminiClient.js` | `config` parameter shadows `config` import from dotenv | Medium | ⚠️ Latent / code smell |
| 5 | `geminiClient.js` | `config.maxTokens` doesn't match `maxOutputTokens` from caller | Medium | ❌ Caller value silently ignored |

